{"seq":2,"slug":"uikit-interop-patterns","title":"UIKit 互操作模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/integration/uikit-interop-patterns","wordCount":517,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"uikit-互操作模式\">UIKit 互操作模式</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>即使 SwiftUI 已覆盖大部分 UI 场景，生产应用仍需桥接 UIKit：复用已有的自定义控件（相机、地图、富文本编辑器）、使用尚无 SwiftUI 对等物的系统 API（UICollectionViewCompositionalLayout、UITextView 的 TextKit 2）、或在 UIKit 宿主应用中嵌入 SwiftUI 子树。桥接的核心协议是 <code>UIViewRepresentable</code> 和 <code>UIViewControllerRepresentable</code>——它们定义了 UIKit 实例的创建、更新和拆除生命周期，并通过 Coordinator 模式桥接委托回调。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant SwiftUI as SwiftUI View Tree&#10;    participant Rep as UIViewRepresentable&#10;    participant Coord as Coordinator&#10;    participant UIK as UIKit View&#10;&#10;    SwiftUI-&gt;&gt;Rep: makeUIView(context:)&#10;    Rep-&gt;&gt;UIK: 创建 UIView 实例&#10;    Rep-&gt;&gt;Coord: makeCoordinator()&#10;    UIK-&gt;&gt;Coord: delegate = coordinator&#10;    SwiftUI-&gt;&gt;Rep: updateUIView(_:context:)&#10;    Rep-&gt;&gt;UIK: 同步 SwiftUI 状态 → UIKit 属性&#10;    UIK-&gt;&gt;Coord: delegate 回调(用户交互)&#10;    Coord-&gt;&gt;SwiftUI: 通过 @Binding 回写状态&#10;    SwiftUI-&gt;&gt;Rep: dismantleUIView(_:coordinator:)&#10;    Rep-&gt;&gt;UIK: 清理资源\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant SwiftUI as SwiftUI View Tree\n    participant Rep as UIViewRepresentable\n    participant Coord as Coordinator\n    participant UIK as UIKit View\n\n    SwiftUI-&gt;&gt;Rep: makeUIView(context:)\n    Rep-&gt;&gt;UIK: 创建 UIView 实例\n    Rep-&gt;&gt;Coord: makeCoordinator()\n    UIK-&gt;&gt;Coord: delegate = coordinator\n    SwiftUI-&gt;&gt;Rep: updateUIView(_:context:)\n    Rep-&gt;&gt;UIK: 同步 SwiftUI 状态 → UIKit 属性\n    UIK-&gt;&gt;Coord: delegate 回调(用户交互)\n    Coord-&gt;&gt;SwiftUI: 通过 @Binding 回写状态\n    SwiftUI-&gt;&gt;Rep: dismantleUIView(_:coordinator:)\n    Rep-&gt;&gt;UIK: 清理资源</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>协议</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>关键方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>UIViewRepresentable</code></td>\n<td>包装 UIView 子类</td>\n<td><code>makeUIView</code> / <code>updateUIView</code> / <code>dismantleUIView</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>UIViewControllerRepresentable</code></td>\n<td>包装 UIViewController</td>\n<td><code>makeUIViewController</code> / <code>updateUIViewController</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>UIHostingController</code></td>\n<td>在 UIKit 中嵌入 SwiftUI View</td>\n<td><code>init(rootView:)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Coordinator</td>\n<td>UIKit delegate/target-action → SwiftUI</td>\n<td><code>makeCoordinator()</code> 返回的 NSObject 子类</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"uiviewrepresentable-完整实现\">UIViewRepresentable 完整实现</h2><p>以包装 UITextView 为例——SwiftUI 原生 TextEditor 不支持富文本属性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"struct RichTextEditor: UIViewRepresentable {&#10;    @Binding var text: NSAttributedString&#10;    var font: UIFont = .preferredFont(forTextStyle: .body)&#10;&#10;    func makeCoordinator() -&gt; Coordinator {&#10;        Coordinator(self)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func makeUIView(context: Context) -&gt; UITextView {&#10;        let textView = UITextView()&#10;        textView.delegate = context.coordinator&#10;        textView.font = font&#10;        textView.allowsEditingTextAttributes = true&#10;        textView.isScrollEnabled = true&#10;        textView.backgroundColor = .clear&#10;        return textView&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func updateUIView(_ uiView: UITextView, context: Context) {&#10;        if uiView.attributedText != text {&#10;            let selectedRange = uiView.selectedRange&#10;            uiView.attributedText = text&#10;            uiView.selectedRange = selectedRange&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    class Coordinator: NSObject, UITextViewDelegate {&#10;        var parent: RichTextEditor&#10;&#10;        init(_ parent: RichTextEditor) {&#10;            self.parent = parent&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        func textViewDidChange(_ textView: UITextView) {&#10;            parent.text = textView.attributedText&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RichTextEditor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">UIViewRepresentable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @Binding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> text: NSAttributedString</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> font: UIFont </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">preferredFont</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">forTextStyle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .body)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> makeCoordinator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Coordinator {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        Coordinator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--