w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">hosting.sizingOptions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [.intrinsicContentSize]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 在 UIKit Cell 中使用时自动计算高度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">hosting.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">view</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">invalidateIntrinsicContentSize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"生命周期注意事项\">生命周期注意事项</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>updateUIView 频繁调用</strong>：SwiftUI 任何相关状态变化都会触发 update，必须做差异比较避免重复设置。</li>\n<li><strong>Coordinator 持有引用</strong>：Coordinator 不应强引用 parent struct（struct 会频繁重建），而是在 update 中同步最新状态。</li>\n<li><strong>dismantleUIView 时机</strong>：视图从层级移除时调用，用于取消定时器、移除观察者、释放资源。</li>\n<li><strong>动画冲突</strong>：UIKit 动画和 SwiftUI 动画互不感知，需要用 <code>context.transaction.animation</code> 判断是否在动画上下文中。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>UIViewRepresentable 三方法生命周期（make → update → dismantle）是桥接核心</li>\n<li>Coordinator 模式将 UIKit 的 delegate/target-action 转译为 @Binding 状态变更</li>\n<li>UIHostingController 实现反向嵌入，sizingOptions 解决自动布局尺寸计算</li>\n<li>坐标空间转换需要显式 <code>convert(_:to:)</code> 调用，注意主线程时序</li>\n<li>差异比较是 updateUIView 的必要实践——避免每次 SwiftUI body 求值都重置 UIKit 状态</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"swiftdata-integration\">本章：SwiftData 持久化集成</a> — SwiftData 对象在 UIKit 视图中的传递与展示</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../swiftui-in-depth/interop-and-advanced/uikit-interop\">SwiftUI 深入 - UIKit 互操作</a> — UIViewRepresentable 的基础用法与常见包装示例</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../swiftui-in-depth/interop-and-advanced/uiviewrepresentable\">SwiftUI 深入 - UIViewRepresentable</a> — Representable 协议的细节与高级用法</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"UIKit 互操作模式","id":"uikit-互操作模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"UIViewRepresentable 完整实现","id":"uiviewrepresentable-完整实现"},{"level":2,"text":"UIViewControllerRepresentable 包装","id":"uiviewcontrollerrepresentable-包装"},{"level":2,"text":"坐标空间转换","id":"坐标空间转换"},{"level":2,"text":"UIHostingController 反向嵌入","id":"uihostingcontroller-反向嵌入"},{"level":2,"text":"sizingOptions 与自动尺寸适配","id":"sizingoptions-与自动尺寸适配"},{"level":2,"text":"生命周期注意事项","id":"生命周期注意事项"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"SwiftData 持久化集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/integration/swiftdata-integration"},"next":{"title":"visionOS 空间 UI 开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/integration/visionos-spatial-ui"}}